      "(13) Not Now",
      "",
      "Apple said that “paradise” is inside VR glasses, inside TVs, inside computers, and inside our bodies. But ...",
      "",
      "“I don’t have ‘paradise’,” I said, “I don’t have ‘paradise’ inside my body.”",
      "",
      "“You don’t now, but Chacha can give it to us,” Apple said.",
      "",
      "“How?”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “When Chacha is with our Wifi, he can give us the ‘paradise’ world.”",
      "",
      "I asked, “Do you have ‘paradise’ now?”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “I don’t have it now, but I know I can get it.”",
      "Chacha gave ‘paradise’ to the VR glasses. Daxing’s dad went to the ‘paradise’ world. He really liked it there, and he wants to live there.”",
      "",
